alues given here take precedence over values defined on the client or passed to this method.","+        extra_headers: Headers | None = None,","+        extra_query: Query | None = None,","+        extra_body: Body | None = None,","+        timeout: float | httpx2.Timeout | None | NotGiven = not_given,","+    ) -> BetaOrganizationUser:","+        \"\"\"","+        Sign a member out of Claude everywhere, without removing them from the","+        organization. This ends their sign-in sessions and removes their trusted devices","+        wherever they use Claude, including other organizations and individual plans. It","+        also ends the OAuth tokens issued to them for this organization, so apps such as","+        Claude Code must sign in again.","+","+        A token can take up to an hour to stop working, though it almost always stops at","+        once. The member keeps their role and can sign in again right away. To keep them","+        out, remove them from the organization or, if your organization uses single","+        sign-on, block them in your identity provider. Signing out does not end API","+        keys, OAuth tokens that were not issued for this organization, or the member's","+        Claude Code cloud sessions and routines.","+","+        You cannot sign out the organization's primary owner or the person your API key","+        or token acts for, and a request to sign out another owner, a member with owner","+        permissions, or a membership admin may be refused. A refused request returns a","+        `400` or `403` error that says why. If the request returns `503`, send it again","+        to finish; anything already ended stays ended.","+","+        Every request must include the beta header","+        `anthropic-beta: admin-user-sign-out-2026-10-08`. A request without it returns","+        `400`. Sign-out is in beta. Anthropic turns it on for each organization and has","+        turned it on for every Claude Enterprise organization; until yours is on,","+        requests also return `400`. In a Claude Enterprise organization, an API key","+        needs the `write:members` scope; a key without it gets `403`.","+","+        Args:","+          user_id: ID of the User.","+","+          betas: This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `admin-user-sign-out-2026-10-08` in","+              this header.","+","+          extra_headers: Send extra headers","+","+          extra_query: Add additional query parameters to the request","+","+          extra_body: Add additional JSON properties to the request","+","+          timeout: Override the client-level default timeout for this request, in seconds","+","+        Raises:","+          BetaCannotSignOutPrimaryOwnerError:","+","+          BetaCannotSignOutSelfError:","+","+          BetaOrganizationNotEnrolledInBetaError:","+","+          BetaCannotSignOutManagedMemberError:","+","+          BetaCannotSignOutMembershipAdminError:","+","+          BetaCannotSignOutOwnerError:","+","+          BetaCannotSignOutPrivilegedMemberError:","+        \"\"\"","+        if not user_id:","+            raise ValueError(f\"Expected a non-empty value for `user_id` but received {user_id!r}\")","+        extra_headers = {","+            **strip_not_given(","+                {","+                    \"anthropic-beta\": \",\".join(chain((str(e) for e in betas), [\"admin-user-sign-out-2026-10-08\"]))","+                    if is_given(betas)","+                    else not_given","+                }","+            ),","+            **(extra_headers or {}),","+        }","+        extra_headers = {\"anthropic-beta\": \"admin-user-sign-out-2026-10-08\", **(extra_headers or {})}","+        return self._post(","+            path_template(\"/v1/organizations/users/{user_id}/sign_out\", user_id=user_id),","+            options=make_request_options(","+                extra_headers=extra_headers,","+                extra_query=extra_query,","+                extra_body=extra_body,","+    